  "body": "QUALITY FAMILY HOME FOR RELOCATION\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a quality 4 bedroom, 2 bathroom home ready to relocate to your site.\r\n\r\nAt 212m², this home offers a practical family-friendly layout with the added bonus of two bathrooms – a sought-after feature in a relocatable home of this size.\r\nPlease see the 2nd floorplan in this listing-this house can easily be made into a 5 bed, 3 bathroom family home.\r\n\r\nNice warm tidy house.\r\nThe plaster exterior is fine (nice and dry) but we think it would look much better reclad in weatherboard similar to the  exiting weatherboards.\r\nOur builders can do this work, lets discuss and work out a plan.\r\nProperty Features:\r\n\r\n4 or 5 bedrooms\r\n2 or 3 bathrooms\r\nApprox. 212m²\r\nPractical family layout\r\nReady for relocation\r\n$345,000 incl. GST\r\n\r\nPrice includes:\r\nDelivery within approx 200km of Auckland and placement onto standard pile foundations.\r\nOur team can reeclad the plaster if you want weatherboard and also lay a concrete pad for the garage.\r\n\r\nForde Brothers can also assist with the relocation and consent process, with 4 experienced in-house architects and contacts for geotechnical and surveying requirements.\r\n\r\nHave land but unsure whether this house will work on your site?\r\nGet in touch with our team and we can discuss access, site requirements and the relocation process with you.\r\nCall Mike – 027 559 9386\r\nMike@fordebrothers.co.nz\r\nMore relocatable homes available – check out our other listings or visit the Forde Brothers website. https://fordebrothers.co.nz/properties/",
